WEBVTT

00:03.350 --> 00:04.260
Nice shot!

00:04.260 --> 00:04.950
All right!

00:04.950 --> 00:06.440
We'll stop here for today.

00:07.620 --> 00:09.880
Subarun, let's practise some more.

00:09.880 --> 00:11.750
It's the summer holidays, anyway!

00:11.750 --> 00:14.890
Well, the training plan is already slightly longer than usual.

00:14.890 --> 00:16.490
It's nowhere near enough!

00:16.850 --> 00:18.870
You should raise it by thirty levels.

00:18.870 --> 00:20.410
We want to participate in competitions as soon as possible!

00:20.410 --> 00:23.300
Hey, when will we be able to participate in competitions?

00:24.190 --> 00:25.650
I have to do some research first.

00:25.650 --> 00:27.160
Go do it, go do it!

00:27.160 --> 00:28.910
I want the five of us to participate as soon as we can!

00:28.910 --> 00:30.630
Everyone wants to participate, right?

00:30.630 --> 00:33.550
Ah... yes...

00:33.550 --> 00:36.870
I want to try participating, too.

00:36.870 --> 00:37.840
Oh~!

00:37.840 --> 00:39.570
It seems fun.

00:39.570 --> 00:45.000
Um,  Hasegawa-san, we want to test our skills, too.

00:45.000 --> 00:46.440
We're counting on you, Subarun!

00:46.440 --> 00:48.210
Yeah.

00:52.900 --> 00:54.900
This is bad...

00:54.900 --> 00:56.900
Maho keeps saying things like that,

00:56.900 --> 01:00.110
but you need at least ten people
to play in an official tournament.

01:00.110 --> 01:02.200
So, they can't participate as they are now?

01:02.200 --> 01:03.180
Nope.

01:03.180 --> 01:05.860
But it's too hard to tell them that now.

01:05.860 --> 01:07.380
And who else knows about it?

01:07.710 --> 01:09.130
Only Tomoka.

01:09.130 --> 01:13.410
Tomoka doesn't really care about official matches, so she didn't tell the others.

01:14.420 --> 01:17.760
I'd rather just wait for a better time to tell them.

01:17.760 --> 01:20.720
It would be meaningless to those girls if it wasn't the five of them taking part.

01:21.290 --> 01:22.600
That's true.

01:33.990 --> 01:37.320
Don't give up and do your best

01:37.320 --> 01:40.700
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

01:40.700 --> 01:43.740
I know perfectly

01:43.740 --> 01:47.420
How weak a person is on their own

01:47.620 --> 01:50.590
Things that are on the verge of being lost

01:50.590 --> 01:54.260
I hold them close to my chest

01:54.260 --> 01:57.220
Your gentle words

01:57.220 --> 02:01.180
Caress my cheeks

02:01.180 --> 02:04.220
The irritation that has been building up

02:04.220 --> 02:07.020
From wanting to reach the goal

02:07.020 --> 02:11.190
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

02:11.190 --> 02:14.780
The place that warms it up

02:14.780 --> 02:17.700
Even if we have to go through the pain

02:17.700 --> 02:21.200
We have to protect this

02:21.200 --> 02:22.660
We're unripe fighters!

02:22.660 --> 02:24.580
We won't lose now

02:24.580 --> 02:27.960
We will raise our small hands up in the air

02:27.960 --> 02:31.380
Take in that vital power, embrace it

02:31.380 --> 02:34.840
Then release it towards the sky!

02:34.840 --> 02:36.380
The courage that cannot be stopped

02:36.380 --> 02:38.220
jump and shoot

02:36.380 --> 02:38.220
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

02:38.220 --> 02:41.140
I will pass the ball to you

02:41.140 --> 02:45.430
The memories that are awoken by our calls

02:45.430 --> 02:48.980
Game

02:45.430 --> 02:48.980
Will move the game along

02:57.230 --> 03:01.410
The Tragedy for Mihoshi (Beautiful Star)

02:57.240 --> 02:59.570
Suzuritani Girls Academy?

02:59.570 --> 03:01.730
If I remember correctly, that's the school that went to the nationals, right?

03:01.730 --> 03:03.270
Aoi, you know a lot about it?

03:03.270 --> 03:04.810
What are you saying?

03:04.810 --> 03:08.370
Didn't we go to watch the finals together when we were in our second year of middle school?

03:08.370 --> 03:09.940
The two of us...

03:09.940 --> 03:12.080
Did we really?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.580
Geez!

03:13.580 --> 03:15.140
That's gross!

03:15.140 --> 03:16.800
Sorry, but I just couldn't-

03:16.800 --> 03:17.960
So what about it?

03:18.400 --> 03:19.750
According to Shouji's relative,

03:19.750 --> 03:22.560
she's a teacher at Suzuritani Elementary School.

03:22.560 --> 03:24.290
On top of that, she's the mini-basketball club advisor.

03:24.290 --> 03:26.290
When I talked to her about Keishin,

03:26.290 --> 03:28.760
she said that she would gladly welcome your team,

03:28.760 --> 03:31.410
since Suzuritani is a boarding school in the mountains.

03:31.410 --> 03:34.000
She also said she would love to have a friendly match against your team.

03:34.000 --> 03:34.900
Here you go.

03:35.420 --> 03:39.130
Isn't this a good chance to let Tomoka-chan and the others experience playing against external teams?

03:39.130 --> 03:41.400
It's just like a training camp, so go and have fun!

03:41.410 --> 03:42.990
You guys...

03:42.990 --> 03:45.490
Of course, President, you're going, too.

03:46.330 --> 03:48.540
I'll tell them, so it'll be fine.

03:49.250 --> 03:51.410
But, I...

03:51.960 --> 03:53.760
The other side are veterans,

03:53.760 --> 03:57.540
so it'll be better if we have one more
person who's familiar with basketball.

03:57.540 --> 03:58.670
That's right.

03:58.670 --> 04:02.530
There are things that girls can only talk about between themselves.

04:03.380 --> 04:04.810
That's true...

04:04.810 --> 04:06.390
Then, I'll leave that to you.

04:07.260 --> 04:08.760
Seems like I've got no choice.

04:08.760 --> 04:11.440
If it's for those girls, I don't mind going.

04:11.440 --> 04:13.020
For those girls.

04:13.930 --> 04:16.030
What, you guys are having another training camp?

04:16.030 --> 04:16.780
That's right.

04:16.780 --> 04:19.440
We're going to have a practice match in the mountains.

04:19.440 --> 04:22.000
But we won't be taking you along, Natsuhi.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.910
Who would want to go?

04:23.910 --> 04:25.290
That's a good thing, though.

04:25.290 --> 04:28.330
If you don't do things like that, you
won't be able to play external matches.

04:28.330 --> 04:29.610
That's right!

04:29.610 --> 04:31.200
Through this, we'll get stronger,

04:31.200 --> 04:34.600
and we'll let the whole world know about us!

04:39.620 --> 04:42.120
I'm looking forward to the training camp tomorrow.

04:42.120 --> 04:44.540
Somehow, I'm so excited that I can't sleep.

04:44.540 --> 04:46.920
I wonder what are our opponents will be like.

04:46.920 --> 04:48.420
It'll be fine.

04:48.420 --> 04:50.940
We won't lose to anyone in teamwork!

04:50.940 --> 04:51.990
Oh~!

04:51.990 --> 04:53.450
Onii-chan will be there, too.

04:53.450 --> 04:54.790
Aoi-chi will come as well.

04:54.790 --> 04:56.230
I'm looking forward to it!

04:56.230 --> 04:57.650
Yup, let's try our best!

04:59.650 --> 05:00.910
Yay!

05:00.910 --> 05:01.650
Oh~

05:01.650 --> 05:03.000
I got the joker...

05:03.000 --> 05:05.570
Hina-chan, you shouldn't tell us.

05:04.810 --> 05:08.160
Use the training camp as a chance to
deepen your relationship with Sensei!

05:09.140 --> 05:10.080
What are you sayi-

05:10.510 --> 05:11.800
If it goes on like this,

05:11.800 --> 05:14.210
Maho-chan and the other girls might take him away.

05:14.210 --> 05:16.050
That won't happen.

05:16.050 --> 05:17.710
They're all elementary school kids.

05:17.710 --> 05:21.140
Well, guys are all beasts.

05:21.140 --> 05:25.330
You should do some investigating into Sensei's background.

05:25.330 --> 05:28.220
Do they think I'm already going out with Subaru?

05:28.500 --> 05:32.140
Um, Subaru-san, would you like to eat some rice balls?

05:32.710 --> 05:34.580
Did you make these, Tomoka?

05:34.580 --> 05:35.490
Yes.

05:35.490 --> 05:37.590
I made them this morning with my mother.

05:37.590 --> 05:38.980
I was just getting hungry.

05:39.650 --> 05:40.690
I'll take one, then.

05:42.180 --> 05:43.730
That was dangerous!

05:43.730 --> 05:45.440
I'm sorry!

05:45.440 --> 05:46.840
I'm the one who should be sorry!

05:46.840 --> 05:48.950
Hey, Miho-nee, why did you stop suddenly?!

05:49.420 --> 05:50.370
Mihoshi-chan?

05:51.070 --> 05:52.700
Hey, what's wrong?

05:53.200 --> 05:54.660
Call an ambulance...

05:55.340 --> 05:56.210
Miho-nee?

05:56.520 --> 05:57.160
Hey!

05:57.160 --> 05:58.960
Miho-nee!

06:05.300 --> 06:08.050
Will Mihoshi-sensei be okay?

06:08.050 --> 06:11.470
Mihoshi-chan said it's probably appendicitis.

06:11.940 --> 06:15.060
Well, knowing her, she'll come back just fine.

06:15.060 --> 06:16.960
That's right.

06:16.960 --> 06:17.830
Oh~!

06:17.830 --> 06:18.940
Mihoshi is strong!

06:19.270 --> 06:23.340
We should hurry, or Mii-tan will worry about us.

06:23.340 --> 06:25.030
They should be waiting for us, too.

06:25.620 --> 06:27.400
We have four more kilometres to go.

06:27.980 --> 06:30.040
That's nothing!

06:30.040 --> 06:31.780
Let's work hard for Mii-tan, too!

06:31.780 --> 06:32.780
Oh!

06:36.750 --> 06:38.810
Amazing.

06:38.810 --> 06:41.760
They have specialised training facilities,

06:41.760 --> 06:44.160
so they can produce elite players.

06:44.160 --> 06:46.600
Somehow, it seems like an evil organisation.

06:46.600 --> 06:47.570
Maho.

06:47.570 --> 06:49.930
Are you the students from Keishin?

06:50.820 --> 06:51.950
Um...

06:51.950 --> 06:53.980
I am the advisor of the mini-basketball club,

06:53.980 --> 06:55.430
Nobidome Hatsue.

06:56.270 --> 06:58.150
I'm sorry we're late.

06:58.150 --> 07:01.330
I'm the coach of Keishin Academy, Hasegawa Subaru.

07:01.330 --> 07:04.520
Thank you very much for inviting us.

07:04.860 --> 07:07.040
Invite?

07:07.040 --> 07:09.270
Never mind.

07:09.270 --> 07:11.660
More importantly, where's the advisor, Takamura-sensei?

07:11.660 --> 07:12.700
Yes.

07:12.700 --> 07:15.630
Like we told you over the phone, she's been taken to hospital.

07:15.630 --> 07:17.910
Before we received the diagnosis, we couldn't-

07:18.150 --> 07:24.270
Still, it's quite irresponsible for a teacher to allow students to come here by themselves.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.870
Hey, what's with that?

07:25.870 --> 07:28.970
Mii-tan did her best to bring us here!

07:28.970 --> 07:33.220
She said she would be fine and told us to go and play the match!

07:33.220 --> 07:34.940
She is not irresponsible!

07:34.940 --> 07:35.650
Oh~!

07:35.650 --> 07:36.390
That's right!

07:37.350 --> 07:39.620
I've heard what you wanted to say.

07:39.620 --> 07:41.760
I shall bring you inside for now.

07:41.760 --> 07:43.770
What about training?

07:44.530 --> 07:48.190
If I introduced you to the team now, it would ruin our schedule.

07:48.850 --> 07:52.020
You wouldn't mind if I introduced you to them tomorrow?

08:04.670 --> 08:09.340
During this period, you shall be resting here.

08:09.340 --> 08:11.790
Um, this is...

08:11.790 --> 08:13.860
We did say that this was a camp.

08:13.860 --> 08:15.510
We never heard about that!

08:16.140 --> 08:17.640
That's strange.

08:17.640 --> 08:20.430
We shall confirm the details regarding that issue.

08:20.430 --> 08:25.000
Um, is there any way for us to stay in the dormitories?

08:25.000 --> 08:25.950
No.

08:25.950 --> 08:27.240
There have been no requests for it.

08:27.240 --> 08:28.360
That's...

08:29.040 --> 08:32.410
The food and shower services have been provided cheaply.

08:32.410 --> 08:35.700
Please set up your tent before it gets dark.

08:35.700 --> 08:37.320
Please wait!

08:37.320 --> 08:39.830
There's one guy, and the rest are girls.

08:39.830 --> 08:41.290
It could cause lots of issues...

08:41.290 --> 08:44.740
Of course, if something indecent occurs,

08:44.740 --> 08:46.210
you'll be forever shamed.

08:46.210 --> 08:48.390
Please reconsider your decision!

08:48.390 --> 08:50.650
Subaru has a habit of being quite perverted,

08:50.650 --> 08:52.660
so he might do something weird to the kids.

08:52.660 --> 08:53.550
It's insulting!

08:54.150 --> 08:57.930
I was more worried about you and Hasegawa-kun, though.

09:00.540 --> 09:02.770
I'm not in that kind of relationship with Subaru.

09:03.240 --> 09:06.030
It also appears that you have not
made any preparations for camping.

09:06.030 --> 09:08.230
Shall I call off the training session?

09:08.810 --> 09:10.420
Wait a moment please!

09:10.420 --> 09:12.570
This is the first external training experience for us,

09:13.210 --> 09:15.630
and the children are really looking forward to this!

09:15.630 --> 09:18.540
We definitely won't cause any problems for you!

09:18.540 --> 09:20.000
Understood.

09:20.000 --> 09:24.790
Therefore, I will make the final decision when Takamura-sensei contacts me.

09:26.980 --> 09:28.760
What should we do, Subaru?

09:28.760 --> 09:30.320
We're doing this for the match.

09:30.320 --> 09:32.460
For now, let's all set up the tent.

09:34.840 --> 09:37.720
Saki, do we just need to put these pegs into the ground?

09:37.720 --> 09:38.730
Yup.

09:38.730 --> 09:40.720
Use that hammer over there.

09:40.720 --> 09:42.310
Oh~!

09:42.310 --> 09:43.840
Roll, roll.

09:43.840 --> 09:46.080
Roll, roll, roll, roll!

09:46.080 --> 09:49.230
Airi, Hina got away~

09:49.900 --> 09:51.480
Cute...

09:51.480 --> 09:54.650
But Hina-chan, I need to use that groundsheet.

09:54.650 --> 09:55.720
No way~

09:55.720 --> 09:56.800
Hina-chan!

09:56.800 --> 09:58.610
They're all such good girls.

09:58.610 --> 09:59.320
Yeah.

10:01.160 --> 10:02.300
We did it!

10:02.300 --> 10:03.730
Yay, it's done!

10:03.730 --> 10:04.450
Thank goodness.

10:05.290 --> 10:06.530
Amazing!

10:06.530 --> 10:08.370
You're done already!

10:09.210 --> 10:10.120
Who is this?

10:10.120 --> 10:11.790
Who knows...

10:11.790 --> 10:14.060
You must be Hasegawa-kun.

10:14.060 --> 10:16.350
Then, is this young lady over here President-chan?

10:16.350 --> 10:17.290
I'm sorry.

10:17.290 --> 10:21.990
Shouji was supposed to tell you about
the camping, but it looks like she didn't.

10:22.730 --> 10:23.530
Um...

10:23.530 --> 10:24.720
May I ask who you are?

10:25.160 --> 10:29.830
I'm a second year student at Suzuritani Girls
Academy's High School Division, Nobidome Manaka.

10:29.830 --> 10:32.100
I'm the temporary coach of the mini-basketball team.

10:34.020 --> 10:35.900
Now it's part of her dark history (whenever she discusses it).

10:36.490 --> 10:37.030
[First Swimsuit] It was a pink, frilly bikini.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.450
Mo-kan!

10:38.450 --> 10:41.400
So you're Nobidome-sensei's younger sister?

10:41.400 --> 10:43.120
Yup, that's right.

10:44.070 --> 10:47.910
In middle school, were you the girls' basketball team's number 4?

10:47.910 --> 10:50.170
How do you know that?

10:50.170 --> 10:55.070
We watched Suzuritani Middle School's match once.

10:55.070 --> 10:56.160
Right, Subaru?

10:56.160 --> 10:57.090
Yeah.

10:59.250 --> 11:00.600
I remember now!

11:00.600 --> 11:03.350
The one who scored points from the three-point line!

11:04.330 --> 11:07.320
You sure are mentioning some cheerful things, aren't you?

11:08.250 --> 11:12.100
Well, I'm resting for this season though.

11:12.660 --> 11:15.900
Anyway, we've got to get the food.

11:28.620 --> 11:31.900
There's a stream with really nice water up ahead.

11:31.900 --> 11:34.460
Subarun, it's a stag beetle!

11:34.460 --> 11:35.630
You're right!

11:35.630 --> 11:36.710
They're rare.

11:36.710 --> 11:39.200
Hey, I want to take a photo!

11:39.200 --> 11:41.050
I want to use it for my research project.

11:42.740 --> 11:45.350
Subarun, a little more to the right.

11:45.350 --> 11:46.570
Oh~!

11:46.570 --> 11:48.180
Maho, good luck!

11:48.710 --> 11:50.310
Don't fall off, Maho-chan!

11:51.060 --> 11:53.650
Just a little more...

11:54.190 --> 11:55.860
Ah, it flew away!

11:55.860 --> 11:57.370
That's dangerous!

11:57.940 --> 11:59.190
Subaru!

12:03.690 --> 12:05.050
That was painful.

12:05.050 --> 12:06.280
I'm sorry, Subarun.

12:06.280 --> 12:09.790
Let's give up on the stag beetle and get to the stream quickly!

12:09.790 --> 12:11.500
Come on, everyone, let's go!

12:11.500 --> 12:14.800
Geez, whose fault do you think it is?

12:12.810 --> 12:14.440
Here we go!

12:19.190 --> 12:22.840
Why is he still smiling even though he was in such pain?

12:23.420 --> 12:27.220
You should do some investigating into Sensei's background.

12:29.750 --> 12:31.840
Everyone's going ahead, Aoi-chan.

12:31.840 --> 12:32.770
Yes!

12:35.350 --> 12:36.830
Take this, Saki!

12:36.830 --> 12:38.460
Hey, what are you doing?

12:38.460 --> 12:39.230
Payback!

12:40.150 --> 12:41.570
Take this, everyone!

12:41.890 --> 12:43.100
Maho!

12:43.100 --> 12:44.080
Oh~!

12:44.080 --> 12:45.390
We're wet~!

12:45.390 --> 12:47.240
It's cold, but it feels good!

12:47.240 --> 12:48.320
There, there!

12:56.490 --> 12:57.380
What is it?

12:57.850 --> 13:01.510
You're very suspicious when you stare at them so intently.

13:02.190 --> 13:03.950
What do you mean, "suspicious"?

13:03.950 --> 13:07.180
It's just that their innocence is cute to look at.

13:08.350 --> 13:10.220
Subarun, come here and join us!

13:10.220 --> 13:11.390
Sure!

13:11.390 --> 13:14.270
He means cute in the normal way, right?

13:14.270 --> 13:20.060
But, he might be looking at them in <i>that</i> way!

13:25.690 --> 13:27.650
Shiny Rice

13:30.050 --> 13:32.040
This should do it.

13:32.450 --> 13:33.160
Mother

13:33.930 --> 13:34.870
Hello?

13:34.870 --> 13:36.080
Subaru-kun?

13:36.650 --> 13:38.560
I just arrived at the hospital.

13:38.560 --> 13:39.960
How is Miho-nee?

13:39.960 --> 13:42.490
As she thought, it was appendicitis.

13:42.490 --> 13:44.420
She has to undergo surgery.

13:44.420 --> 13:46.200
It's okay.

13:46.200 --> 13:48.550
She was still talking cheerfully just a while ago.

13:48.550 --> 13:53.470
She's just worried about everyone because she can't take part in the training camp.

13:54.080 --> 13:57.350
We'll be fine somehow, so tell her that.

13:57.970 --> 14:00.010
Thanks for calling.

14:01.230 --> 14:03.070
Staff Room

14:01.670 --> 14:03.070
She's undergoing surgery?

14:03.070 --> 14:07.400
That means Takamura-sensei won't be able to attend the training camp at all.

14:07.400 --> 14:08.410
I'm terribly sorry.

14:08.410 --> 14:10.850
If she's sick, it can't be helped!

14:10.850 --> 14:13.690
Geez, stop bullying them, Onee-chan.

14:13.690 --> 14:15.540
I'm not bullying them.

14:15.540 --> 14:21.420
We don't mind camping outside, but please don't cancel the training camp, for the children's sake!

14:21.860 --> 14:23.050
Please!

14:23.050 --> 14:24.700
Understood.

14:24.700 --> 14:25.920
Then it shall proceed as planned.

14:25.920 --> 14:27.840
Thank you very much!

14:27.840 --> 14:29.830
Let's eat!

14:29.830 --> 14:32.540
Maho, you're putting too much in!

14:32.540 --> 14:33.740
It's fine!

14:33.740 --> 14:36.580
Curry isn't delicious unless it's spicy.

14:36.580 --> 14:39.770
Will Mihoshi-sensei's surgery go smoothly?

14:39.770 --> 14:43.400
My mother will be there, so it'll be fine.

14:43.810 --> 14:46.250
It would be great if she can get better quickly.

14:46.250 --> 14:47.740
Hina will pray!

14:47.740 --> 14:48.900
That's right.

14:48.900 --> 14:50.400
Let's all pray.

14:50.400 --> 14:51.350
Oh~!

14:51.350 --> 14:55.160
Thank you for helping us negotiate with Nobidome-sensei.

14:55.160 --> 14:57.250
I didn't do anything.

14:57.250 --> 14:58.210
Oh, that's right.

14:58.210 --> 14:59.490
What are your plans for bathing?

14:59.490 --> 15:00.710
Everyone will go, right?

15:00.710 --> 15:01.650
We'll go!

15:01.650 --> 15:03.710
We sweated quite a bit, too.

15:03.710 --> 15:05.580
Got it.

15:05.580 --> 15:08.670
However, there's one problem.

15:13.890 --> 15:16.290
I'm really sorry, Hasegawa-kun!

15:16.290 --> 15:19.180
It's a girls school, so there are no male baths.

15:19.180 --> 15:20.980
It's fine.

15:20.980 --> 15:22.780
We'll see you.

15:22.780 --> 15:25.310
Onii-chan should just go in with us.

15:25.310 --> 15:26.430
He can't do that, Hina!

15:25.560 --> 15:27.180
We're off!

15:26.430 --> 15:28.780
We're sorry, Hasegawa-san.

15:33.410 --> 15:34.990
Hina, how was it?

15:34.990 --> 15:36.750
What's Manaka-chi's cup size?

15:36.750 --> 15:37.770
Oh~!

15:37.770 --> 15:38.910
It's a B-cup!

15:38.910 --> 15:40.460
Airi wins!

15:41.770 --> 15:43.210
I'm fine with not winning!

15:43.210 --> 15:44.530
Hey, Airi.

15:44.530 --> 15:46.870
How do you get your breasts to grow so big?

15:46.870 --> 15:49.020
I wouldn't know anything about that!

15:49.020 --> 15:51.090
Aoi-chi's also quite big.

15:51.090 --> 15:54.120
They definitely have something in common.

15:54.120 --> 15:55.350
Something in common?

15:55.350 --> 15:56.690
Oh~!

15:56.690 --> 15:58.770
Their names begin with "A".

15:58.770 --> 16:00.000
Oh!

16:00.000 --> 16:00.980
That's it!

16:01.740 --> 16:03.980
Then, should we call you Aho from now on?

16:01.740 --> 16:03.980
TL Note: "Aho" means "idiot" in Japanese.

16:05.520 --> 16:08.470
But, Amoka is pretty weird.

16:08.470 --> 16:12.060
My parents carefully chose my name for me.

16:12.060 --> 16:13.860
I don't want to change it.

16:13.860 --> 16:16.240
Tomo, you're taking it too seriously.

16:18.480 --> 16:20.110
This feels good.

16:20.110 --> 16:23.410
Just what I'd expect from an elite school. The facilities are great.

16:23.410 --> 16:24.040
Hey.

16:24.040 --> 16:27.500
Aoi-chan, you like Hasegawa-kun, right?

16:29.300 --> 16:31.300
It's so obvious.

16:31.300 --> 16:32.490
It's not true!

16:32.490 --> 16:33.300
That's-

16:33.300 --> 16:38.220
But his relationship with the girls is so good, it's worrisome, right?

16:38.220 --> 16:39.860
Senpai...

16:39.860 --> 16:41.340
I hit the nail on the head, it seems.

16:41.340 --> 16:45.740
Well, a coach and his students do have a special relationship.

16:45.740 --> 16:47.760
Is that really the case?

16:47.760 --> 16:49.930
If you want, I'll help you out.

16:49.930 --> 16:52.780
At a training camp, there'll be plenty of chances.

16:52.780 --> 16:53.900
Right?

16:56.400 --> 16:57.830
Ah, I'm doing it wrong.

16:57.830 --> 17:00.660
I should do some push-ups before I wipe off my sweat.

17:01.200 --> 17:02.270
41...

17:02.270 --> 17:03.120
42...

17:03.120 --> 17:04.460
43...

17:04.460 --> 17:05.400
44...

17:05.400 --> 17:07.750
If someone saw me now...

17:16.700 --> 17:19.220
It's a monstrous, giant salamander!

17:19.490 --> 17:21.460
Help!

17:19.490 --> 17:21.460
Um, I'm not-

17:21.460 --> 17:23.640
Wait, a giant salamander?

17:28.420 --> 17:31.030
Being seen was pretty bad.

17:32.820 --> 17:34.280
Subaru-san!

17:34.470 --> 17:36.070
Welcome back.

17:36.070 --> 17:39.610
Sorry, I thought you guys were still in the bath.

17:39.610 --> 17:41.910
I had something I wanted to do.

17:42.310 --> 17:43.540
Something you wanted to do?

17:44.140 --> 17:48.240
If you're okay with it, would you like to join me, Subaru-san?

18:00.090 --> 18:01.190
I'm sorry.

18:01.190 --> 18:03.010
Since it's dark...

18:03.900 --> 18:05.010
It's nothing!

18:05.010 --> 18:06.400
Um...

18:06.400 --> 18:07.940
Thank you.

18:19.240 --> 18:20.890
It's beautiful.

18:24.440 --> 18:26.290
Thank you, Tomoka.

18:27.070 --> 18:31.900
If I'd been alone, I probably wouldn't have
thought about looking at this beautiful, starry sky.

18:31.900 --> 18:32.840
Thank you.

18:33.580 --> 18:34.480
It's nothing.

18:34.480 --> 18:38.880
I'm happy that I got to see the stars with you.

18:41.570 --> 18:45.450
I have some stars that I want to see,

18:45.450 --> 18:48.180
but it seems like they only appear in winter.

18:48.630 --> 18:52.060
So I'm planning to go stargazing again in winter.

18:52.060 --> 18:53.480
I see.

18:53.480 --> 18:54.730
What are the names of these stars?

18:57.190 --> 18:58.320
It's a secret.

18:59.960 --> 19:02.990
When we go to look at them again, tell me the names.

19:03.760 --> 19:05.190
Yes.

19:08.240 --> 19:09.410
Tomo, welcome back.

19:09.410 --> 19:10.620
Did you manage to see the stars?

19:10.620 --> 19:11.120
Yup.

19:11.120 --> 19:13.790
What are the two of you doing outside?

19:13.790 --> 19:15.650
What are you talking about, Subarun?

19:13.790 --> 19:17.510
Mi no hi~ Goro goro~

19:15.650 --> 19:17.550
We were waiting for you!

19:17.510 --> 19:21.890
Minna moshi goro goro~ Minna moshi goro goro~

19:19.720 --> 19:21.890
We wanted to ask you about who's sleeping where.

19:21.890 --> 19:25.520
Mi no hi~ Goro goro~

19:21.890 --> 19:24.320
Ah, we didn't think about that.

19:24.320 --> 19:27.200
Well, you're free to sleep anywhere.

19:25.520 --> 19:31.310
Minna moshi goro goro~ Minna moshi goro goro~

19:27.200 --> 19:29.040
I'll sleep near the entrance.

19:29.040 --> 19:31.310
Then, I'll sleep next to you.

19:31.800 --> 19:35.190
I can't let you sleep next to the children.

19:35.190 --> 19:36.780
Yeah, whatever.

19:41.690 --> 19:44.910
His face is too close.

19:51.500 --> 19:55.170
In the end, I was so aware of him, I couldn't sleep.

19:55.720 --> 19:58.360
It's a good chance to watch how other schools practise,

19:58.360 --> 19:59.550
so let's try to learn something from them.

19:59.550 --> 20:02.180
Let's steal their moves!

20:02.180 --> 20:03.240
You're all pumped up.

20:03.240 --> 20:05.660
I wonder if we can keep up with their practice.

20:05.660 --> 20:06.640
It'll be fine.

20:06.640 --> 20:08.550
We just have to follow them as best as we can.

20:08.550 --> 20:09.470
Oh~!

20:09.470 --> 20:10.560
Let's do our best!

20:10.560 --> 20:11.480
Oh!

20:16.640 --> 20:19.480
A male!

20:19.480 --> 20:20.740
The one from last night...

20:20.740 --> 20:21.920
Sensei!

20:21.920 --> 20:26.240
Why is there a male in Miyu's holy court?!

20:26.660 --> 20:30.910
This sports hall doesn't have a rule
stating that males aren't allowed to enter.

20:30.910 --> 20:33.960
Having a male supervisor is normal.

20:33.960 --> 20:38.820
That aside, to think that we're having combined practice with these amateurs who're wearing uniforms like that!

20:38.820 --> 20:41.510
Even though we have an important match ahead of us!

20:41.930 --> 20:45.060
Of course, we will not let them interfere with our regular players.

20:45.060 --> 20:48.720
We will have the students from Keishin practice with our lower year students.

20:49.140 --> 20:51.220
But, Onee-chan!

20:51.220 --> 20:52.590
That's not good enough.

20:52.590 --> 20:55.110
At least take a look at these girls' abilities!

20:55.110 --> 20:56.440
That's right, that's right!

20:56.440 --> 20:59.040
We won't lose that easily!

20:59.040 --> 20:59.900
Oh~!

20:59.900 --> 21:01.390
Everyone's strong.

21:03.610 --> 21:05.390
You seem to have quite a lot of confidence.

21:05.390 --> 21:07.870
There seems to be only five of you though.

21:07.870 --> 21:09.740
Have you ever taken part in an official match?

21:10.360 --> 21:11.830
We're going to take part!

21:11.830 --> 21:15.120
So for that to happen, we'll defeat you first!

21:17.790 --> 21:19.670
What's so funny?

21:19.670 --> 21:22.570
To think that you were <i>such</i> an amateur.

21:22.570 --> 21:24.630
You don't seem to know, so I'll enlighten you.

21:25.800 --> 21:28.050
In order to participate in an official mini-basketball tournament,

21:28.050 --> 21:30.890
your team must have at least ten people. Otherwise you can't take part.

21:31.890 --> 21:35.060
To think that you want to beat Miyu and the rest of us without knowing such a thing.

21:35.060 --> 21:37.200
It means you're a hundred years too early!

21:37.200 --> 21:40.730
Also, normally, someone is <i>supposed</i> to tell you this.

21:42.310 --> 21:43.140
Well...

21:43.140 --> 21:43.900
I'm sorry.

21:47.710 --> 21:48.490
Maho!

21:57.790 --> 22:00.790
♪Party love Party love Party love (fuufuu)

22:00.790 --> 22:03.340
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:13.060 --> 22:14.390
Come on! Come on!

22:14.390 --> 22:17.140
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.140 --> 22:19.650
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.650 --> 22:21.230
But that's a lie!

22:21.230 --> 22:22.320
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.610 --> 22:24.940
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.360 --> 22:28.030
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:28.030 --> 22:30.740
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.740 --> 22:32.120
Triple A

22:32.120 --> 22:33.990
I don't need any ratings

22:33.990 --> 22:36.000
I want to grow up faster!

22:36.000 --> 22:36.790
Dribble!

22:36.790 --> 22:37.460
Zig-zag

22:37.460 --> 22:38.120
Defence!

22:38.120 --> 22:39.000
Offence (Yep!)

22:39.000 --> 22:41.080
I want to shoot the ball

22:41.830 --> 22:49.130
I want to be praised soon... by you

22:49.680 --> 22:52.180
"Look here. Look here. It's going to end!"

22:52.180 --> 22:54.850
Jump! Jump!

22:55.140 --> 22:57.350
More and more and more

22:58.230 --> 23:03.060
When can I become an adult

23:03.060 --> 23:08.860
I'm growing! It's painful! The painful sores.

23:09.150 --> 23:13.660
However, I'll definitely show you that I can endure it

23:13.660 --> 23:20.870
Shake, Bounce, Touch, Aim for the goal!

23:21.250 --> 23:24.340
Ah! I want to grow up faster!

23:25.330 --> 23:26.280
It's Mihoshi!

23:26.280 --> 23:27.770
It's so cold!

23:27.770 --> 23:29.430
What's with this treatment?!

23:29.430 --> 23:33.300
It's not that my stomach hurts because of this treatment!

23:33.300 --> 23:35.730
Anyway, work hard, everyone!

23:35.730 --> 23:38.470
I'll be watching over you guys from afar!

23:37.010 --> 23:40.010
The Bridge for Five People

23:37.010 --> 23:40.010
Next
